# MsgBill Master Blueprint (msgbill.com)

## Dual engines

1. **Public utility & AdSense (guest / no login)**  
   Free GST bill generator + SEO guides. Monetize via AdSense + affiliates. Conversion CTA to signup.

2. **Private SaaS (logged-in)**  
   100% ad-free dashboard: cloud invoices, WhatsApp reminders, Razorpay UPI links, clients, inventory. Free → Pro ₹499/year.

## Non-negotiable rules

1. **Never gate** `/free-invoice-generator` behind auth. Guests must create/download/share bills without login.
2. **Never render ads** inside `/dashboard/*`. Suppress all AdSense/affiliate tags for logged-in SaaS.
3. **GST math**: exact rounded decimals (Rate × Qty + Tax); no float drift. Preserve CGST+SGST vs IGST slabs (0/5/12/18/28).
4. **Build clean**: `npm run build` must pass; new public routes stay statically generable where intended.
5. **SEO**: every new public page/blog needs JSON-LD + entry in `app/sitemap.ts`.

## Key files to maintain

- `components/generator/FreeInvoiceGenerator.tsx` — client-side jspdf/wa.me tool
- `app/free-invoice-generator/page.tsx` — SEO landing + WebApplication/FAQ schema + AdSense slots
- `components/ads/AdSenseAd.tsx` — reads `NEXT_PUBLIC_ADSENSE_CLIENT_ID`; never use under dashboard
- `app/contact/page.tsx`, `components/contact/ContactForm.tsx` — AdSense compliance
- `app/privacy/page.tsx` — DART / third-party ad disclosure
- `app/blog/page.tsx`, `app/blog/[slug]/page.tsx` — pillar guides (ads OK on public blog)
- `app/sitemap.ts` — tools, compliance, all blog slugs

## Monetization copy anchors

- Guest CTA: "Want an ad-free experience and save your invoices for 1 year? Sign Up Free — No Credit Card Required"
- Pro: ₹499/year via Razorpay (not ₹10; not monthly unless product changes)
- Free SaaS tier limits live in `lib/limits.ts` — keep marketing copy aligned with code

## Out of scope for guest engine

Do not add login walls, payment collection SaaS features, or org RLS on the free generator. Keep it client-side and zero-friction.
